{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2022-11-17 16:30:00', 'title': 'PEPSICO DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'PURCHASE, N.Y. , NOV. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF PEPSICO, INC. (NASDAQ: PEP) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.15 PER SHARE OF PEPSICO COMMON STOCK, A 7 PERCENT INCREASE VERSUS THE COMPARABLE YEAR-EARLIER PERIOD.'}